  "section_9_delta": "Row 2 ends the writer's first attempt before the critic is wanted: a reviewer waits for its subject's creator to finish (V3), so the critic's review of draft 1 starts only then. Row 3 ends the critic before the later Revise attempt; the published section 9 row omits these WorkerEnded events, leaving the original writer live and conflicting with C7 one-live-attempt semantics. Row 6 wants the critic once the failed revise has ended."
